  <entry>
    <author>
      <name>李润</name>
    </author>
    <category term="学习笔记" scheme="https://stalin-coser.github.io/categories/%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/"/>
    <category term="Vue" scheme="https://stalin-coser.github.io/tags/Vue/"/>
    <category term="JavaScript" scheme="https://stalin-coser.github.io/tags/JavaScript/"/>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<p>第一次使用 <code>ref</code> 时，最容易混淆的是变量本身与它包装的值。分清这两层，很多响应式问题就更容易理解。</p><span id="more"></span><h2 id="把值放进响应式容器"><a href="#把值放进响应式容器" class="headerlink" title="把值放进响应式容器"></a>把值放进响应式容器</h2><figure class="highlight javascript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">import</span> &#123; ref &#125; <span class="keyword">from</span> <span class="string">&#x27;vue&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line"><span class="keyword">const</span> count = <span class="title function_">ref</span>(<span class="number">0</span>)</span><br><span class="line">count.<span class="property">value</span>++</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>count</code> 指向这个响应式容器，<code>count.value</code> 才是里面的数值。</p><h2 id="模板与脚本的写法"><a href="#模板与脚本的写法" class="headerlink" title="模板与脚本的写法"></a>模板与脚本的写法</h2><p>脚本中通过 <code>.value</code> 读写。模板中通常可以直接写 <code>&#123;&#123; count &#125;&#125;</code>，因为模板会进行解包。</p><h2 id="对象里面的属性也可以修改"><a href="#对象里面的属性也可以修改" class="headerlink" title="对象里面的属性也可以修改"></a>对象里面的属性也可以修改</h2><figure class="highlight javascript"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><span class="line"><span class="keyword">const</span> form = <span class="title function_">ref</span>(&#123; <span class="attr">name</span>: <span class="string">&#x27;&#x27;</span> &#125;)</span><br><span class="line">form.<span class="property">value</span>.<span class="property">name</span> = <span class="string">&#x27;约尔&#x27;</span></span><br><span class="line">form.<span class="property">value</span> = &#123; <span class="attr">name</span>: <span class="string">&#x27;新的名字&#x27;</span> &#125;</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>第一行修改对象属性，第二行替换容器中的整个对象。两者都没有把 <code>form</code> 变量改为一个普通对象。</p>]]>
    </content>
    <id>https://stalin-coser.github.io/posts/vue-ref/</id>
